<https://data.archives.gov.on.ca/KB/RecordSet/RG%201-429> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#scopeAndContent> "Series consists of records created in the different stages of forest resource inventory.  Series includes aerial photography and related key maps, indices and flight reports.  Series also includes forest resource inventory data and maps, showing the area, volume and type of forest resources in surveyed and unsurveyed areas of the province as well as reports and correspondence documenting how the forest resource inventory was conducted.  Series is arranged into sixteen sub-series based on record type or subject." .
